Third-party agent skills vendored under `.agents/skills/`

This directory is development tooling. Nothing under `src/` imports it and it is
not part of the shipped app. It is kept in the repository so a contributor's
coding agent sees the same instructions the maintainer used.

The skills are third-party works, redistributed here unmodified under their own
licences. `skills-lock.json` records the upstream repository, path and content
hash for each one. The mapping and notices below are the authoritative licence
statement for this directory.


