expo-animation
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

This skill bundles its own licence, kept beside it at
`.agents/skills/expo-animation/LICENSE`. That file governs that skill; the Expo
notice above applies to the rest of the Expo skills.


graphify
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

`graphify` (reported version 0.9.92 in `.graphify_version`) is vendored, but its
upstream repository and licence were never recorded in `skills-lock.json`.

It is NOT covered by either notice above. Establish its provenance and licence
before publishing this repository, or remove `.agents/skills/graphify/`.
